</div>
{{exp}}

Intercept and kill the [[orc runner]] in Nektulos Forest. Obtain the [[Sealed Letter]] from its corpse. It details a conspiracy between the Crushbone Orcs and the Dark Elves against the Ogres. Bring the letter to Lork in Oggok:

: Lork says 'What this!! So, dark elves think they can bash ogres. Replace with blue orcs. Dumb Zulort friend with dark elf ambassador in Oggok. We kill him. We kill Crushbone dark elf ambassador also. This slow down plan. We need a hero. Me guess you do. You go. Go bring Lork both Crushbone and Oggok dark elf hearts. Then you be hero.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Craknek Warriors]] got better. (10)
* Your faction standing with [[Clurg]] got better. (1)
* Your faction standing with [[Green Blood Knights]] got worse. (-1)
</div>
{{exp}}

You receive a random item at this point (occasionally a bronze weapon).

'''You'll need to bring to Lork the hearts of "Lord Crushbone" and "the Dark Elf Ambassador" who visits the shaman guild in Oggok.'''

The Dark Elf Ambassador is named [[Ambassador K`Ryn]] and is located in Komarr's Caves (the tunnels). If you enter the tunnels through the bottom right tunnel, continue through until you reach the Shaman Guildmasters. Go to the right and you'll see about six Ogre merchants who sell Shaman spells. In that room there is another tunnel which will bring you to a room with about five different passages. In one of those passages waits the Dark Elf Ambassador. Kill him and get his heart. He also often drops a dragoon dagger. Beware faction here... for killing K`ryn, you lose faction with Indigo Brotherhood (but gain with Emerald Warriors and Steel Warriors).

Kill Ambassador K`Ryn.

Ambassador K`Ryn's corpse says 'Start digging your grave. The Indigo Brotherhood shall find you.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Indigo Brotherhood]] got worse. (-200)
* Your faction standing with [[Emerald Warriors]] got better. (30)
* Your faction standing with [[Steel Warriors]] got better. (10)
* Your faction standing with [[Primordial Malice]] got better. (400)
</div>

Loot his heart?

Lord Crushbone is [[Ambassador DVinn]] in Crushbone. Kill him and loot his [[Black Heart]].

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Indigo Brotherhood]] got worse. (-75)
* Your faction standing with [[Emerald Warriors]] got better. (11)
* Your faction standing with [[Steel Warriors]] got better. (3)
* Your faction standing with [[Primordial Malice]] got better. (150)
</div>

Return to Lork.

: Lork says 'This one dead. Where other? Lork say Crushbone heart and Oggok heart.'

: Lork says 'That show dark elves who strongest. Me hope you kill many blue orcs. You Craknek Hero now. You take this. It mine. Hero reward. You great ogre now. Smash best.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Craknek Warriors]] got better. (25)
* Your faction standing with [[Clurg]] got better. (3)
* Your faction standing with [[Green Blood Knights]] got worse. (-3)
</div>

The reward varies and is often bad (patchwork armor, for example). You'll rarely get a {{:Crude Stein}} or {{:Gatorsmash Maul}}.

